sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Client
    participant F as Formulaire RDV
    participant S as Serveur Laravel
    participant BD as Base de Donnees
    C->>F: Choisir un service
    F->>S: Requete services disponibles
    S->>BD: SELECT services actifs
    BD-->>S: Liste des services
    S-->>F: Afficher services
    C->>F: Choisir un employe
    F->>S: Requete employes pour ce service
    S->>BD: SELECT employes (pivot employee_service)
    BD-->>S: Liste des employes
    S-->>F: Afficher employes
    C->>F: Choisir date et creneau
    F->>S: Requete creneaux disponibles
    S->>BD: Verifier horaires, conges, RDV existants
    BD-->>S: Creneaux libres
    S-->>F: Afficher creneaux
    C->>F: Valider le rendez-vous
    F->>S: POST /client/appointments
    S->>BD: INSERT appointment (status=pending)
    BD-->>S: RDV cree
    S->>BD: INSERT notification employe
    S->>BD: INSERT notification client
    S-->>F: Confirmation RDV
    F-->>C: Afficher confirmation
